      "content": "i rly feel like i'm just drowning everyone else too. everything is just getting so expensive and i can't keep up, it feels like every time i try to help things just get worse. i look at my kids and then i look at the bills and i just feel like a massive weight around their necks. they'd have so much more room to breathe if i wasn't constantly dragging them down with my failures.",
