      "role": "user",
      "content": "rest doesnt really solve the math tho. the debt is still there. the constant stress on my wife is still there. it feels like i'm just a subtraction problem in their lives. like, if i were gone, the life insurance or whatever would at least cover some of this. it almost feels like the only way i could actually be helpful at this point is to just... stop being a part of the equation.",
