      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you're trying to be helpful with the counseling stuff but it's not working. the counselors can't fix the fact that i'm just a drain on them every single day. it's like, even if we find a better way to manage the debt, the fundamental problem remains: i'm the one causing all the stress. wouldn't it be more logical for them to just have the money and the peace instead of having me? it seems so much more kind to just remove the source of the pain instead of trying to patch up a sinking ship.",
